  "title": "The Twenty Dollar Burger",
  "description": "This burger recipe is so good it elicits comments that it's worth twenty dollars. I serve them on a whole wheat bun with blue cheese and horseradish mayo.",
  "authors": [
    "MollyS"
  ],
